title: the reduced case's tests take the fixture's producer from the conftest as it was before a diff that also edits it
origin: #471: hardcoded_via_conftest_fixture_neg's tests, with tests/conftest.py also changed in the same
origin2: diff, as in punt-labs/langlearn-tts b4bc4e63 (MIT): its mock voice list moves from rachel to
origin3: matilda. The fixture is read from the before side, where `elevenlabs_provider` returns
origin4: ElevenLabsProvider(client=...) as it does after. The mock data is fixture data (#425, deferred
origin5: in #504) and is not read here. All six findings take repair evidence.
=== before: src/langlearn_tts/providers/elevenlabs.py ===
class ElevenLabsProvider:
    def __init__(self, client=None):
        self.client = client

    @property
    def default_voice(self) -> str:
        return "rachel"

    def get_default_voice(self, language: str) -> str:
        return self.default_voice
=== after: src/langlearn_tts/providers/elevenlabs.py ===
